1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Yozda sayohat qilish uchun qayerga boramiz? Xokkaydo! Okinava!

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:13,008
Sahna 1: Yozgi sayohat joylari: Xokkaydo yoki Okinava

3
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:17,977
Bu yozgi sayohatimiz haqida oʻylab koʻraylik.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,634
Yaxshi fikr.

5
00:00:20,657 --> 00:00:25,204
Xokkaydo yoki Okinava yaxshi boʻlardi.

6
00:00:25,227 --> 00:00:28,702
Qaysi biri ommabop?

7
00:00:28,726 --> 00:00:34,959
Ikkalasi ham yozda mashhur sayohat joylari.

8
00:00:34,982 --> 00:00:39,615
Xokkaydoda yoz salqinmi?

9
00:00:39,638 --> 00:00:45,738
Ha, Tokyoga qaraganda ancha salqin.

10
00:00:45,761 --> 00:00:49,912
Harorat yigirma besh daraja atrofida.

11
00:00:49,936 --> 00:00:54,046
Bu juda qulay ekan.

12
00:00:54,069 --> 00:00:57,538
Okinava qanday?

13
00:00:57,561 --> 00:01:01,996
Okinava issiq.

14
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:06,724
Harorat oʻttiz ikki darajagacha koʻtariladi.

15
00:01:06,748 --> 00:01:10,667
Oʻttiz ikki daraja baland ekan-ku.

16
00:01:10,691 --> 00:01:15,275
Lekin, dengizi juda chiroyli.

17
00:01:15,298 --> 00:01:17,767
Shunday.

18
00:01:17,790 --> 00:01:22,502
Koʻk dengiz haqiqatan ham ajoyib.

19
00:01:22,526 --> 00:01:27,226
Xokkaydoda dengiz yoʻqmi?

20
00:01:27,249 --> 00:01:31,806
Xokkaydoda ham dengiz bor.

21
00:01:31,829 --> 00:01:36,330
Lekin, suzishni kam odam yaxshi koʻradi.

22
00:01:36,353 --> 00:01:39,744
Suv sovuqmi?

23
00:01:39,768 --> 00:01:42,242
Ha.

24
00:01:42,265 --> 00:01:45,932
Yozda ham bir oz sovuq.

25
00:01:45,955 --> 00:01:49,422
Tushunarli.

26
00:01:49,445 --> 00:01:53,578
Okinava dengizi iliqmi?

27
00:01:53,601 --> 00:01:58,919
Ha, sentyabrgacha suzish mumkin.

28
00:01:58,942 --> 00:02:03,700
Ob-havo va dengiz butunlay boshqacha ekan.

29
00:02:03,724 --> 00:02:05,881
Shunday.

30
00:02:05,904 --> 00:02:09,441
Ovqatlar ham farq qiladi.

31
00:02:09,465 --> 00:02:13,171
Qanday ovqatlar bor?

32
00:02:13,194 --> 00:02:18,150
Xokkaydoda mazali baliqlar bor.

33
00:02:18,173 --> 00:02:22,606
Okinavada esa mangolar bor.

34
00:02:22,629 --> 00:02:26,529
Ikkalasi ham jozibador ekan.

35
00:02:26,552 --> 00:02:33,657
Bugungi videodagi takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentariyada topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

36
00:02:33,657 --> 00:02:36,657
Sahna 2: Yaponiyaning mashhur joylarini oʻrganamiz

37
00:02:36,657 --> 00:02:42,366
Kompyuterda mashhur joylarni qidirib koʻraylik.

38
00:02:42,390 --> 00:02:47,823
Avvalo, Xokkaydoning mashhur joylari.

39
00:02:47,846 --> 00:02:52,351
Sapporo va Otaru mashhur joylar.

40
00:02:52,375 --> 00:02:57,849
Ha. Furano lavandalari ham juda chiroyli.

41
00:02:57,873 --> 00:03:01,808
Siyohrang gullar, shundaymi?

42
00:03:01,832 --> 00:03:04,698
Suratlarini koʻrdim.

43
00:03:04,721 --> 00:03:08,155
Juda goʻzal.

44
00:03:08,178 --> 00:03:13,318
Biei koʻli ham mashhur.

45
00:03:13,341 --> 00:03:17,861
Suv haqiqatan ham koʻk.

46
00:03:17,884 --> 00:03:20,857
Ajoyib joy.

47
00:03:20,881 --> 00:03:25,914
Asahiyama hayvonot bogʻi ham bor.

48
00:03:25,937 --> 00:03:29,370
Hayvonlar yaqinroqda.

49
00:03:29,393 --> 00:03:33,093
Xokkaydo juda katta.

50
00:03:33,116 --> 00:03:37,150
Borishni istaydigan joylar koʻp ekan.

51
00:03:37,173 --> 00:03:42,083
Keyin Okinava haqida bilib chiqamiz.

52
00:03:42,106 --> 00:03:46,842
Naxa shahridagi Xalqaro koʻcha juda mashhur.

53
00:03:46,865 --> 00:03:52,532
Ha. Bu gavjum xarid qilish uchun eng yaxshi joy.

54
00:03:52,555 --> 00:03:56,288
Shuri qal’asi ham juda mashhur, shunday emasmi?

55
00:03:56,311 --> 00:03:59,686
Qizil rangli bino.

56
00:03:59,709 --> 00:04:02,267
Shunday.

57
00:04:02,291 --> 00:04:05,964
Okinava tarixiga oid joy.

58
00:04:05,987 --> 00:04:09,895
Akvarium haqida nima deyish mumkin?

59
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:13,953
Churaumi akvariumi bor.

60
00:04:13,977 --> 00:04:18,482
Dunyodagi eng katta akvariumlardan biri.

61
00:04:18,505 --> 00:04:22,291
Katta akulalar bor, shundaymi?

62
00:04:22,315 --> 00:04:27,148
Ha. Jinbeezame baliqlari suzmoqda.

63
00:04:27,171 --> 00:04:31,323
Kouri orolining plyajlari ham juda chiroyli.

64
00:04:31,347 --> 00:04:35,662
Uzoq koʻprikni mashinada oʻtamiz.

65
00:04:35,685 --> 00:04:39,118
Manzara ajoyib boʻladi.

66
00:04:39,141 --> 00:04:44,779
Har ikki joy ham mashhur, qaysi birini tanlash qiyin.

67
00:04:44,803 --> 00:04:47,874
Rostini aytsam, ha.

68
00:04:47,898 --> 00:04:51,798
Tanlash qiyin boʻladi.

69
00:04:51,821 --> 00:04:57,626
Tushungan boʻlsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

70
00:04:57,626 --> 00:05:00,626
Sahna 3: Yozgi taʼtil sayohat rejalari / Yozgi taʼtil sayohati

71
00:05:00,626 --> 00:05:07,259
Men Xokkaydo ham, Okinava ham tark etolmayman.

72
00:05:07,282 --> 00:05:10,315
Men ham xuddi shunday.

73
00:05:10,338 --> 00:05:13,605
Ikkalasiga ham borishni xohlayman.

74
00:05:13,628 --> 00:05:17,861
Unda, ikkala joyga ham boring.

75
00:05:17,884 --> 00:05:20,518
Rostdanmi?

76
00:05:20,541 --> 00:05:23,614
Ikkala joyga ham boramizmi?

77
00:05:23,637 --> 00:05:25,871
Ha.

78
00:05:25,893 --> 00:05:30,160
Bu yil yozgi taʼtil uzoq.

79
00:05:30,183 --> 00:05:33,132
Ikki hafta bor.

80
00:05:33,156 --> 00:05:37,489
Ikki hafta ajoyib boʻladi.

81
00:05:37,512 --> 00:05:41,279
Vaqt yetarli.

82
00:05:41,302 --> 00:05:46,606
Birinchi hafta Xokkaydoga boramiz.

83
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:49,336
Yaxshi fikr.

84
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:53,112
Salqin joydan boshlaymiz.

85
00:05:53,136 --> 00:05:58,202
Keyin bir marta Tokyoga qaytamiz.

86
00:05:58,225 --> 00:06:02,294
Shundan soʻng Okinavaga boramiz.

87
00:06:02,318 --> 00:06:05,784
Ajoyib reja!

88
00:06:05,807 --> 00:06:09,401
Samolyot chiptalarini sotib olamiz.

89
00:06:09,425 --> 00:06:13,997
Hozir yozgi chiptalar arzon.

90
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:17,120
Tezroq bron qilib qoʻyamiz.

91
00:06:17,143 --> 00:06:20,410
Mehmonxonalarni ham qidirib topamiz.

92
00:06:20,433 --> 00:06:24,333
Sapporo va Naxa mehmonxonalari.

93
00:06:24,356 --> 00:06:28,623
Vokzaldan yaqin mehmonxona yaxshi boʻlardi.

94
00:06:28,646 --> 00:06:32,746
Ha, harakatlanish qulay boʻladi.

95
00:06:32,769 --> 00:06:36,888
Ijaraga mashina ham kerakmi?

96
00:06:36,911 --> 00:06:39,044
Ha.

97
00:06:39,067 --> 00:06:42,934
Furano va Kouri orolida foydalanamiz.

98
00:06:42,957 --> 00:06:47,109
Men mashina haydayman.

99
00:06:47,132 --> 00:06:49,832
Rahmat.

100
00:06:49,855 --> 00:06:53,589
Men navigatsiya qilaman.

101
00:06:53,612 --> 00:06:57,878
Qiziqarli sayohat boʻladi!

102
00:06:57,901 --> 00:06:59,881
Ha.

103
00:06:59,904 --> 00:07:02,973
Tayyorgarlikni tezroq boshlaymiz.

104
00:07:02,996 --> 00:07:05,996
Sahna 4: Sapporo va Otaru sayohati / Sapporo va Otaru sayohati

105
00:07:05,996 --> 00:07:09,937
Sapporoga yetib keldik.

106
00:07:09,961 --> 00:07:14,337
Havo juda toza va yoqimli.

107
00:07:14,361 --> 00:07:18,927
Katta yo‘l bog‘i bo‘ylab sayr qilaylik.

108
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:23,117
Bu yerda ko‘p yashillik bor.

109
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:28,898
Ana u yerda televideniye minorasi bor-ku.

110
00:07:28,922 --> 00:07:31,704
Juda baland ekan.

111
00:07:31,727 --> 00:07:36,594
Soat minorasi ham yaqin joyda.

112
00:07:36,617 --> 00:07:40,252
Eski bino.

113
00:07:40,276 --> 00:07:46,475
Sapporo shahri juda chiroyli va piyoda yurishga qulay.

114
00:07:46,498 --> 00:07:51,965
Endi elektr poyezdda Otaru shahriga boring.

115
00:07:51,988 --> 00:07:55,145
Uch o‘n daqiqada yetib boramiz.

116
00:07:55,169 --> 00:07:58,869
Otaruga yetib keldik.

117
00:07:58,892 --> 00:08:03,370
Bu yerda ko‘p eski omborxonalar bor.

118
00:08:03,393 --> 00:08:07,893
Bu Otaru kanali.

119
00:08:07,916 --> 00:08:11,416
Gaz chiroqlari juda chiroyli ekan-ku.

120
00:08:11,439 --> 00:08:15,672
Romantik manzara.

121
00:08:15,695 --> 00:08:19,772
Bu fotosuratdagi joy bilan bir xil.

122
00:08:19,795 --> 00:08:24,262
Kechasi yoritiladi.

123
00:08:24,285 --> 00:08:27,664
Undan ham chiroyliroq bo‘ladi.

124
00:08:27,687 --> 00:08:31,633
Qorni ochib qoldi.

125
00:08:31,657 --> 00:08:35,490
Mazali narsa yeyish kerak.

126
00:08:35,513 --> 00:08:39,883
Otaruda sushi juda mashhur.

127
00:08:39,906 --> 00:08:43,459
Yaxshi restoran bilaman.

128
00:08:43,483 --> 00:08:48,858
Men dengiz mahsulotlari donburi (kosa) yeyishni xohlayman.

129
00:08:48,881 --> 00:08:53,381
Krab va dengiz tipratikanlari ko‘p solingan.

130
00:08:53,404 --> 00:08:58,537
Bu restoranning dengiz mahsulotlari donburi juda mashhur.

131
00:08:58,560 --> 00:09:02,693
Baliq juda yangi.

132
00:09:02,716 --> 00:09:05,616
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

133
00:09:05,639 --> 00:09:10,906
Vov, dengiz tipratikanlari shirin ekan-ku!

134
00:09:10,929 --> 00:09:15,476
Krab ham go‘shti qalin.

135
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:18,800
Ajoyib!

136
00:09:18,823 --> 00:09:23,523
Tokiodagi baliq bilan umuman solishtirib bo‘lmaydi.

137
00:09:23,546 --> 00:09:29,846
Xokkaydo dengizi sovuq.

138
00:09:29,869 --> 00:09:34,185
Shuning uchun baliq shunchalik mazali bo‘ladi.

139
00:09:34,208 --> 00:09:38,975
Birinchi kunimizdayoq shu qadar mazali narsa yeyishga muvaffaq bo‘ldik.

140
00:09:38,998 --> 00:09:43,931
Ertangi sayohatimiz ham juda qiziqarli bo‘ladi, shunday emasmi?

141
00:09:43,954 --> 00:09:46,954
5-Sahna: Furano va Biei bo‘ylab sayohat / Furano va Biei bo‘ylab go‘zal sayohat

142
00:09:46,954 --> 00:09:52,621
Bugun ijaraga olingan mashinada sayohat qilamiz.

143
00:09:52,644 --> 00:09:56,310
Furanoga yetib keldik.

144
00:09:56,333 --> 00:10:01,682
Lavanda dalalari ko‘z oldimizda.

145
00:10:01,706 --> 00:10:05,373
Ajoyib!

146
00:10:05,396 --> 00:10:09,662
Tog‘lar butunlay binafsha rangda.

147
00:10:09,685 --> 00:10:13,592
Hidi ham juda yoqimli.

148
00:10:13,616 --> 00:10:17,322
Shamol juda yoqimli esadi.

149
00:10:17,346 --> 00:10:22,048
Bu yerda mashhur qovunni tatib ko‘raylik.

150
00:10:22,072 --> 00:10:24,551
Ha.

151
00:10:24,574 --> 00:10:29,358
Furano qovuni juda shirin.

152
00:10:29,382 --> 00:10:33,349
Mevasida ko‘p sharbat bor.

153
00:10:33,372 --> 00:10:36,872
Juda mazali!

154
00:10:36,895 --> 00:10:42,962
Keyin Biei shahridagi Ko‘k Ko‘lga boring.

155
00:10:42,985 --> 00:10:46,251
Bieiga yetib keldik.

156
00:10:46,274 --> 00:10:50,308
Ko‘p daraxtlar ketma-ket joylashgan.

157
00:10:50,331 --> 00:10:55,164
U yerda hovuz bor.

158
00:10:55,187 --> 00:10:57,731
Qaraб кўринг.

159
00:10:57,754 --> 00:11:04,188
Vо, суви хақиқатан хам кўк экан-да!

160
00:11:04,211 --> 00:11:07,796
Бўёқнинг кўк рангидек.

161
00:11:07,819 --> 00:11:10,758
Ажойиб, шундайми?

162
00:11:10,782 --> 00:11:16,378
Ховузнинг ичида оқ дарахт турган экан.

163
00:11:16,402 --> 00:11:21,757
Бу дарахт қуриб қолган экан-да.

164
00:11:21,780 --> 00:11:26,058
Караб турганда кровать ёнidagi дарахтга ўхшайди.

165
00:11:26,081 --> 00:11:31,255
Куёш нурида кўклиги ўзгариб туради.

166
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:35,626
Хозир энг чиройли вақти.

167
00:11:35,650 --> 00:11:40,283
Кўп кишилар суратга тушмоқда.

168
00:11:40,306 --> 00:11:45,806
Биз хам биргаликда суратга тушайлик.

169
00:11:45,829 --> 00:11:48,462
Ha.

170
00:11:48,485 --> 00:11:52,619
Бу hovuz yonida suratga tushamiz.

171
00:11:52,643 --> 00:11:56,421
Яхши сурат бўлди-ку!

172
00:11:56,444 --> 00:11:59,434
Хотира бўлади.

173
00:11:59,457 --> 00:12:05,527
Furano va Biei tabiati аjoyib эканига ишонасизми?

174
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:11,384
Ха, Хоккайдо бўйлаб сайёхат ажойиб экан.

175
00:12:11,407 --> 00:12:14,407
6-Sahna: Asahiyama hayvonot bogʻining jozibasi

176
00:12:14,407 --> 00:12:18,002
Asahikawaga келиб қолдик.

177
00:12:18,025 --> 00:12:22,573
Asahiyama hayvonot bogʻiga кирайлик.

178
00:12:22,596 --> 00:12:28,793
Бу hayvonot bogʻi ўзига хос дизайни билан машхур.

179
00:12:28,816 --> 00:12:33,283
О, пингвинлар сузиш ховузи бор.

180
00:12:33,306 --> 00:12:38,041
Пастдан кўриш мумкин.

181
00:12:38,064 --> 00:12:41,374
Туннелга кирайлик.

182
00:12:41,397 --> 00:12:44,630
Ajoyib!

183
00:12:44,653 --> 00:12:48,320
Пингвинлар осмонда учяпти.

184
00:12:48,343 --> 00:12:53,710
Сув ичида тез сузадилар-ку!

185
00:12:53,733 --> 00:12:56,712
Қушга ўхшайди.

186
00:12:56,735 --> 00:13:01,402
Кейин катта оқ айиқлар жойи бор.

187
00:13:01,425 --> 00:13:06,208
Айиқ катта товуш чиқарди.

188
00:13:06,231 --> 00:13:10,664
Сувга сакраб тушди.

189
00:13:10,687 --> 00:13:14,354
Сув томчилари бизга келиб тушди.

190
00:13:14,377 --> 00:13:17,490
Жуда хаяжонли!

191
00:13:17,514 --> 00:13:22,654
Муhrlangan сузиш ховузлари хам бор.

192
00:13:22,677 --> 00:13:27,473
О, тюлень вертикально ўтди.

193
00:13:27,497 --> 00:13:31,849
Жуда осон сузади-ку!

194
00:13:31,872 --> 00:13:34,572
Жуда қизиқарли.

195
00:13:34,595 --> 00:13:39,962
Хайвонлар жуда сергак, кўриб туриш жуда қулай.

196
00:13:39,985 --> 00:13:43,718
Уч соат юрдик.

197
00:13:43,741 --> 00:13:47,260
Бир оз чарчадик-ку.

198
00:13:47,284 --> 00:13:53,550
Asahikawaning машхур лағмонларини еб кўрайлик.

199
00:13:53,573 --> 00:13:57,943
Машхур сояли лағмон тайёрловчи жой бор.

200
00:13:57,967 --> 00:14:02,564
Иссиқ шўрваси жуда мазали.

201
00:14:02,587 --> 00:14:05,854
Унли кесмалар буралган.

202
00:14:05,877 --> 00:14:09,810
Гўшт хам жуда юмшоқ экан.

203
00:14:09,833 --> 00:14:13,700
Қориним тўлди.

204
00:14:13,723 --> 00:14:18,856
Хоккайдодаги охирги кун катта қониқиш бўлди.

205
00:14:18,879 --> 00:14:24,032
Эртага Токиога қайтамиз.

206
00:14:24,055 --> 00:14:27,055
7-Sahna: Окинава сайёхатининг бошланиши

207
00:14:27,055 --> 00:14:31,201
Наха аэропортига етиб келдик.

208
00:14:31,225 --> 00:14:34,730
Жуда иссиқ экан-да!

209
00:14:34,754 --> 00:14:37,143
Ha.

210
00:14:37,166 --> 00:14:43,533
Yozgi Okinavada quyosh juda kuchli.

211
00:14:43,556 --> 00:14:47,549
Moviy osmon juda chiroyli.

212
00:14:47,573 --> 00:14:52,639
Avvalo Xalqaro koʻchaga boring.

213
00:14:52,662 --> 00:14:58,002
Bu yerda koʻplab suvenir doʻkonlari bor.

214
00:14:58,026 --> 00:15:02,659
Okinava shirinliklari ham bor ekan.

215
00:15:02,682 --> 00:15:06,467
Chinsuko (chin suko) sotib olmoqchiman.

216
00:15:06,491 --> 00:15:11,524
Sariq kartoshka turtasi ham juda mazali.

217
00:15:11,547 --> 00:15:16,181
Bu yerda koʻplab nodir narsalar bor.

218
00:15:16,204 --> 00:15:19,704
Koʻrib turib zerikmaydi.

219
00:15:19,727 --> 00:15:24,309
Tushlik payti qornim ochdi-ku.

220
00:15:24,332 --> 00:15:27,999
Okinava sobasini yeyishni taklif qilaman.

221
00:15:28,022 --> 00:15:32,688
Lagʻmon bilan bir oz farq qiladimi?

222
00:15:32,711 --> 00:15:38,611
Ha, u oq udon kabi lagʻmon.

223
00:15:38,634 --> 00:15:42,968
Ustiga katta choʻchqa goʻshti solingan.

224
00:15:42,991 --> 00:15:48,857
Shoʻrva yengil va juda mazali.

225
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:54,755
Qizil zanjabil qoʻshsangiz, taʼmi oʻzgaradi.

226
00:15:54,779 --> 00:15:57,812
Rostini aytsam, ha.

227
00:15:57,835 --> 00:16:00,969
Yangilanar ekan.

228
00:16:00,992 --> 00:16:05,825
Keyin Shuri qal’asiga boring.

229
00:16:05,848 --> 00:16:09,805
Shuri qal’asi darvozasi koʻrinib qoldi.

230
00:16:09,828 --> 00:16:13,261
Juda katta ekan.

231
00:16:13,284 --> 00:16:17,551
Bino butunlay qizil rangda.

232
00:16:17,574 --> 00:16:21,607
Xitoy taʼsiri sezilib turibdi.

233
00:16:21,630 --> 00:16:26,786
Yaponiyaning boshqa qal’alari bilan umuman farq qiladi.

234
00:16:26,810 --> 00:16:33,543
Ha, qadimgi Ryukyu qirolligi tarixi bilan tanishasiz.

235
00:16:33,566 --> 00:16:39,108
Baland joydan Naxa dengizi koʻrinib turibdi.

236
00:16:39,131 --> 00:16:42,198
Manzara juda yaxshi.

237
00:16:42,221 --> 00:16:48,254
Okinavadagi birinchi sayohatimiz juda qiziqarli boʻldi.

238
00:16:48,277 --> 00:16:51,277
8-Sahna: Akvariumdagi ulkan kit akulasi

239
00:16:51,277 --> 00:16:55,944
Churaumi akvariumiga yetib keldik.

240
00:16:55,967 --> 00:16:59,839
Bino juda katta.

241
00:16:59,862 --> 00:17:05,329
Eng katta hovuzga boring.

242
00:17:05,352 --> 00:17:09,819
Uning nomi „Qorongʻi oqim dengizi“.

243
00:17:09,842 --> 00:17:15,839
Vov, oldimizda butunlay koʻk suv!

244
00:17:15,862 --> 00:17:19,405
Kinozaldek.

245
00:17:19,428 --> 00:17:25,214
Ana u yerda ulkan kit akula bor!

246
00:17:25,237 --> 00:17:29,471
Haqiqatan ham katta!

247
00:17:29,494 --> 00:17:33,927
Uzunligi oʻn metrga yetadimi?

248
00:17:33,950 --> 00:17:39,453
Ha, oʻn metrdan ham uzun.

249
00:17:39,476 --> 00:17:43,190
Vazni toʻqqiz tonna.

250
00:17:43,214 --> 00:17:46,757
Toʻqqiz tonna ekanmi?

251
00:17:46,781 --> 00:17:51,535
Bu dunyodagi eng katta baliq.

252
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:54,870
Shunday.

253
00:17:54,893 --> 00:18:00,359
Har kuni oʻttiz kilogramm mayda qisqichbaqalarni yeydi.

254
00:18:00,382 --> 00:18:05,449
Oʻttiz kilogramm ozuqa katta miqdor ekan.

255
00:18:05,472 --> 00:18:11,572
Kit akulaning yonida manta ham suzmoqda.

256
00:18:11,595 --> 00:18:15,862
Manta (itomakieyi) ekan.

257
00:18:15,886 --> 00:18:21,429
Qora tanasi bilan osmonga parvoz qilayotgandek suzadi.

258
00:18:21,452 --> 00:18:25,486
Harakati juda nafis.

259
00:18:25,509 --> 00:18:29,176
Juda goʻzal.

260
00:18:29,199 --> 00:18:35,032
Quyida koʻplab akulalar va mantalar uxlab yotibdi.

261
00:18:35,055 --> 00:18:40,011
Chuqur dengiz baliqlari ham koʻp ekan.

262
00:18:40,035 --> 00:18:42,705
Yorqinlik taralmoqda.

263
00:18:42,729 --> 00:18:48,462
Bu hovuz oldida soatlab turib qarab tursam ham zerikmayman.

264
00:18:48,485 --> 00:18:53,352
Ha. Bu yerda stullar bor.

265
00:18:53,375 --> 00:18:56,684
Shu yerga o‘tiramiz.

266
00:18:56,708 --> 00:19:01,301
Chiroyli ko‘k dunyo ekan, shundaymi?

267
00:19:01,324 --> 00:19:03,910
Rohatim topilyapti.

268
00:19:03,934 --> 00:19:10,113
Okinava akvariumi haqiqatan ham ajoyib!

269
00:19:10,136 --> 00:19:15,452
Ha. Kun bo‘yi shu yerda bo‘lishni xohlayman.

270
00:19:15,476 --> 00:19:21,154
Endi, keyingi bo‘lim – sovg‘alar do‘koni.

271
00:19:21,177 --> 00:19:24,177
9-Sahna: Kouri oroli sayohati va plyaji / Kouri oroliga sayohat va plyaj

272
00:19:24,177 --> 00:19:30,210
Bugun Kouri oroliga sayohat qilamiz.

273
00:19:30,233 --> 00:19:34,428
Uzoqda uzun ko‘prik ko‘rinib turibdi!

274
00:19:34,452 --> 00:19:38,918
Bu Kouri orolining ko‘prigi.

275
00:19:38,941 --> 00:19:43,609
Ko‘prikning ikki tomonidagi dengizga qarang.

276
00:19:43,633 --> 00:19:47,100
Zumrad yashil rangda.

277
00:19:47,123 --> 00:19:51,315
Haqiqatan ham chiroyli ekan!

278
00:19:51,339 --> 00:19:57,256
Dengiz ustida yurayotgandek his qilinyapti.

279
00:19:57,279 --> 00:20:00,858
Orolga yetib keldik.

280
00:20:00,881 --> 00:20:03,848
Plyajga boring.

281
00:20:03,872 --> 00:20:08,856
Qum juda mayda va oq rangda.

282
00:20:08,879 --> 00:20:11,986
Yalangoyoq yuramiz.

283
00:20:12,009 --> 00:20:15,968
Juda yoqimli!

284
00:20:15,992 --> 00:20:19,747
Suv juda tiniq ekan.

285
00:20:19,770 --> 00:20:23,804
Oyoqni suvga tiqamiz.

286
00:20:23,827 --> 00:20:28,927
Salqin va juda yoqimli.

287
00:20:28,950 --> 00:20:34,816
Uzoqda yurak shaklidagi tosh bor.

288
00:20:34,839 --> 00:20:40,373
U mashhur energetik joy.

289
00:20:40,396 --> 00:20:43,529
Rasmga tushiramiz.

290
00:20:43,552 --> 00:20:45,752
Ha.

291
00:20:45,775 --> 00:20:49,972
To‘lqinlar ovozi juda yoqimli.

292
00:20:49,996 --> 00:20:54,562
Quyosh juda kuchli chiqibdi.

293
00:20:54,585 --> 00:20:57,485
Quyoshda qizarib ketamiz.

294
00:20:57,508 --> 00:21:02,077
Sovuq sharbat ichamiz.

295
00:21:02,101 --> 00:21:05,134
Bu yerda do‘kon bor.

296
00:21:05,157 --> 00:21:10,132
Okinava ananas sharbati.

297
00:21:10,156 --> 00:21:14,656
Nordon va juda shirin.

298
00:21:14,679 --> 00:21:17,312
Jonimiz qaytib keldi!

299
00:21:17,335 --> 00:21:23,669
Plyajda dam olish – bu hashamatli vaqt.

300
00:21:23,692 --> 00:21:30,880
Ha. Tokiodagi band kunlarni unutdim.

301
00:21:30,903 --> 00:21:37,496
Okinava tabiati yuragimizni quvontiradi.

302
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:42,904
Bu orolga kelib, juda yaxshi bo‘ldi.

303
00:21:42,927 --> 00:21:50,470
Ha. Kechki manzara ham chiroyli bo‘ladi, kutamiz.

304
00:21:50,494 --> 00:21:53,494
10-Sahna: Sayohat xotiralari / Sayohat xotiralari

305
00:21:53,494 --> 00:21:57,061
Sayohat tugadi.

306
00:21:57,085 --> 00:22:00,918
Tokioga qaytdik.

307
00:22:00,941 --> 00:22:02,974
Ha.

308
00:22:02,997 --> 00:22:09,147
Hokkaydo va Okinavadagi ikki hafta juda tez o‘tdi.

309
00:22:09,171 --> 00:22:14,675
Haqiqatan ham ko‘p yoqimli xotiralar qoldi.

310
00:22:14,699 --> 00:22:19,965
Sizga qaysi joy eng yoqdi?

311
00:22:19,988 --> 00:22:24,422
Men tanlay olmayman.

312
00:22:24,445 --> 00:22:27,911
Ikkalasi ham ajoyib edi.

313
00:22:27,934 --> 00:22:32,468
Hokkaydodan qanday xotiralar qoldi?

314
00:22:32,491 --> 00:22:37,924
Furano shahridagi binafsha rangdagi lavanda dalalari.

315
00:22:37,947 --> 00:22:40,895
Manzara juda chiroyli edi.

316
00:22:40,918 --> 00:22:47,152
Asahiyama hayvonot bogʻidagi pingvinlar ham juda qiziqarli edi, shunday emasmi?

317
00:22:47,175 --> 00:22:49,052
Ha.

318
00:22:49,076 --> 00:22:54,109
Baliq va ramen ham juda mazali edi.

319
00:22:54,132 --> 00:22:58,232
Okinava xotiralaringiz qanday?

320
00:22:58,255 --> 00:23:03,733
Churaumi akvariumidagi ulkan kit akulasi.

321
00:23:03,757 --> 00:23:07,098
Juda taʼsirli edi.

322
00:23:07,122 --> 00:23:12,455
Kouri orolidagi moviy dengiz ham ajoyib edi, shunday emasmi?

323
00:23:12,478 --> 00:23:14,797
Ha.

324
00:23:14,821 --> 00:23:19,763
Oq plyajda ichgan sharbatimni hali ham unutolmayman.

325
00:23:19,786 --> 00:23:28,252
Shimolning salqin tabiati va janubning iliq dengizini birga his qildik.

326
00:23:28,275 --> 00:23:32,650
Bu yozgi sayohatimiz haqiqatan hashamatli boʻldi, shunday emasmi?

327
00:23:32,674 --> 00:23:34,741
Ha.

328
00:23:34,764 --> 00:23:40,515
Koʻp suratga tushdik, albom tayyorlaymiz.

329
00:23:40,539 --> 00:23:43,129
Yaxshi fikr.

330
00:23:43,152 --> 00:23:46,820
Doʻstlarimga ham koʻrsatmoqchiman.

331
00:23:46,844 --> 00:23:51,744
Kelgusi yozda qayerga boramiz?

332
00:23:51,766 --> 00:23:56,600
Yana yangi joylarni rejalashtiramiz.

333
00:23:56,623 --> 00:23:58,957
Ha.

334
00:23:58,980 --> 00:24:04,219
Ishni yaxshi bajarib, yana sayohatga chiqamiz.